cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the paper below."
title: "fishdx — Visual embedding retrieval for the perception–cognition gap in aquatic pathology (code deposit)"
abstract: >-
  Three-stage deterministic vision-language pipeline (Florence-2 perception with
  two-tier pareidolia correction, lambda-weighted CLIP fusion retrieval over a
  fused-embedding image gallery, and evidence-pool scoring with a margin-gated
  three-way decision) for training-free, retrieval-augmented fine-grained fish
  disease classification. This is the code deposit accompanying the manuscript.
